		<title type="html"><![CDATA[C2A: CCD library for general polygon soup models]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=13946#p13946"><![CDATA[
We announce the release of a free, real-time continuous collision detection library for rigid, polygon-soup models.<br><br><a href="http://graphics.ewha.ac.kr/C2A/" class="postlink">http://graphics.ewha.ac.kr/C2A/</a><br><br>The performance of C2A is superior or comparable to that of a specialized algorithm for a 2-manifold surface model (e.g. <a href="http://graphics.ewha.ac.kr/FAST" class="postlink">http://graphics.ewha.ac.kr/FAST</a>).<br><br>Any feedback or bug-report will be appreciated.<br><br>Thank you.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1784">youngjkim</a> — Fri Jun 12, 2009 5:38 am</p><hr />
